        "instruction": {
          "title": "Watch domains settle",
          "description": "Observe two, then three, then four electron domains rearrange themselves into the minimum-repulsion arrangement. Notice the temporary repulsion vectors as the domains move apart, then settle into linear, trigonal planar, and tetrahedral geometries."
